{"ID":"20240118145005-11axn28","Spec":"2","Type":"NodeDocument","Properties":{"id":"20240118145005-11axn28","scroll":"\u0026#123;\u0026quot;rootId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240118145005-11axn28\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;startId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240118145005-8w2dq9s\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;endId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240122163921-lqet9hk\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;scrollTop\u0026quot;:200,\u0026quot;focusId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240122163921-lqet9hk\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;focusStart\u0026quot;:182,\u0026quot;focusEnd\u0026quot;:182\u0026#125;","title":"355苦瓠（苦瓠子）","type":"doc","updated":"20240204154227"},"Children":[{"ID":"20240118145005-8w2dq9s","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240118145005-8w2dq9s","updated":"20240122163823"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color2);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"【本经原文】味苦，寒，有毒。治大水，面目四肢浮肿，下水，令人吐。生川泽。"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color2);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240122163825-s15wkrs","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122163825-s15wkrs"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color2);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"【产地】产我国山西，他省亦多有之，瓤及子入药。 "},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color2);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240122163828-hkiepfn","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122163828-hkiepfn"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color2);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"【性味】味苦，性寒，有毒。 "},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color2);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240122163830-90hcwi2","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122163830-90hcwi2"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color2);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"【主治】苦瓠主治水肿，利小便，通淋，治疮。 "},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color2);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240122163831-82ql3rz","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122163831-82ql3rz"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color2);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"【苏敬】利石淋，吐呀嗽。囊结疰蛊，痰饮。又煮汁渍阴，疗小便不通。"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color2);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240122163833-aneme7v","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122163833-aneme7v"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color2);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"【藏器】煎汁滴鼻中出黄水，去伤冷鼻塞黄疸。 "},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color2);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240122163835-m2zux80","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122163835-m2zux80"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color2);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"【大明】吐蛔虫。 "},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color2);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240122163838-1p3pipz","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122163838-1p3pipz"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color2);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"【用量】普通二至三钱，大剂无定量。 "},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color2);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240122163840-yopf5vm","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122163840-yopf5vm"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color2);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"【禁忌】服苦瓠过分吐利不止者，以黍穰灰汁解之。"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color2);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240122163840-wt8ujqv","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122163840-wt8ujqv"}},{"ID":"20240122163840-mpx1ydl","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122163840-mpx1ydl","updated":"20240204153941"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"355，苦瓠，那这个苦瓠呢，跟台湾吃的那个苦瓠名字类似但是长得不太一样，你不要把台湾的苦瓜拿来做，味苦有寒有毒。"}]},{"ID":"20240122163845-c22lkrc","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122163845-c22lkrc","updated":"20240204153952"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"它的瓜和它的籽入药，能够四肢排便，水肿排水，所以苦瓠主治水肿。很多的水肿，我这里大致分一下，等我们介绍金匮到时候我还会再分更细。"}]},{"ID":"20240122163852-3ldpamh","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122163852-3ldpamh","updated":"20240204154102"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"我们有一篇专门论水肿的，有一篇专门论风水啊皮水啊很多，这里先给你们一个简单的概念，你读了那么多本草里面东西，很多都有利水。我们有两种水"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"：一种肝病，肝病造成的水的时候，那个腹水肚子很大，这个时候我们是以健脾为主，把脾脏功能健起来，所以我们开很多处方，都是比如苍术、白术啊，泽泻、车前啊，木通啊，灯芯草都是健脾利湿甘淡渗利的药。"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240122163857-h71xq0e","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122163857-h71xq0e","updated":"20240204154121"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"那你如果是肾脏病，很多人肾脏有问题也会水肿，堵在下面，下焦、两个腿、脚都肿起来，这些肾脏病的水肿的时候，主力的药，我们用一些商陆、甘遂，用一些甘遂、牵牛之类的把水排掉。"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240122163900-oxtfxdp","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122163900-oxtfxdp","style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);","updated":"20240204154132"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"那如果水跑到肺里面去的时候，我们用一些甘遂、芫花、大戟这个来清它。"}]},{"ID":"20240122163904-ki66h1i","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122163904-ki66h1i","style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);","updated":"20240122163906"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"如果由肺里面跑到胁间里面去了，我们可以用一些生半夏。"}]},{"ID":"20240122163911-65rxm57","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122163911-65rxm57","style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);","updated":"20240204154131"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"那有些人积水跑到子宫里面去造成子胀，子宫里面堵起来，我们用一些甘遂啊、大黄啊放在里边。"}]},{"ID":"20240122163912-cfd7573","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122163912-cfd7573","style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);","updated":"20240204154126"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"那如果是治水，它是外面的风水，就是皮肤整个肿起来，这时候中医是用发汗的方法，汗一发水就退掉。"}]},{"ID":"20240122163920-w3vn9rh","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122163920-w3vn9rh","updated":"20240204154140"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"所以我们光是治水我们有很多种处方不一样，以后我会慢慢再讲，因为现在本草只是单味的药，讲太多等于偏离主题，那以后我在讲《伤寒》《金匮》我会把它归类给你看，这样就会很清楚了。"}]},{"ID":"20240122163921-lqet9hk","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122163921-lqet9hk","updated":"20240204154227"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"这里的苦瓠呢，一般来说这里治水肿不太可能去治疗肝硬化的水肿啊，腹水。但是它能够小便小得不是很好，不顺利小便小不出来也可以吃它，有些这个是肾结石啊，这种可以做，你看，陈【藏器】，藏器是个医生，煎之滴鼻疽，可以出黄水，气伤的人，这个鼻塞的黄胆。这个都是看看，因为现在我们苦瓠很少用，可能诸位如果以后有机会到这个山西的地方可以看到苦瓠，就是那个东西，一般都是食品类的。"}]}]}